      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "This end of degree project was designed by the student Alicia Ulierte
    Ar\xE9valo, from Universidad Rey Juan Carlos, with the tutorship of Prof. David
    Rold\xE1n \xC1lvarez. The aim of this project is to teach future technicians
    on the proper procedure and use of MRI scan, and to provide patients with an
    experience close to real life of what it is like to be examined inside an MRI
    scan. \n\nThis ambitious project is providing the opportunity of experiencing
    this type of medical exam so that the user is familiarized with the devices and
    allows the training for saving real life time and optimizing the hospital workflow
    for the future.\n\nObj\n\r\n"
