      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Alright, we\u2019re all set. \nI\u2019m going to position you right in
    the center of the scanner. \nYou\u2019ll hear some loud sounds, which is normal,
    but you\u2019ll have ear protection. \nPlease stay as still as you can \u2014
    even small movements can blur the images. \nIf you feel uncomfortable, you can
    press the red button below, and I\u2019ll stop the scan right away. \nTry to
    stay as still as possible during the exam, and remember to breathe normally.
    \n\nIf you need anything, just let me know through the intercom.\nJust relax,
    keep still, and we\u2019ll take care of everything.\n\n"
